<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-28T05:59:35.563Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 05:59:35 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Jordan has carried out additional airstrikes in Syria, saying they hit Islamic State targets linked to a recent church attack that killed nine people, while Syrian authorities report civilian deaths from the raids. Syria has condemned the strikes as a breach of its airspace and an unacceptable violation, and a joint Jordan-Syria security committee is being formed to investigate. Families of civilians killed in the attacks have held funerals, and Jordan says it killed more than 20 Islamic State militants in the operations. The conflict produced 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/27/world/middleeast/jordan-syria-strikes-attack.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNWUx2TkFCNmEzdGdyRzBPS2o1dXVPSUUxUFFndkFpQmhraUxvZ1dpNGpzZERjbTFfSjVBYUJiTUdsdzVLOFEwT2RhWFRNSVYzTkNfWlp0LV9MQmNMUnFpSE5FVC1wWG1COW1YSGxGckltREZzaWFlR0FkMEpRUGFTR2VyTW1TNXhfdC1BMC1FT3JHZUxkT0dyZURsdTZQZ085SldkRDNVTXI5aER6SlZtUllHd1Y3QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxOdHFuTnlKdUxQNFE3RVJQVkRyWEd6UERyNnpOelVYak0tMU1OekpmWEJySmVMY3JaN25XNWRoY2gxSkhHbjRoOFFaR3hiZk5oVnZfOFZIT2ZvUjJ0T2I0QmpUUGdzTUdVdkVnMkVTLURBNEJmNTZBOXVGTEh5R0EyVzVpS0pZU3poQmd4aFE0YnJ2SXdPejhNbUFkRndveUVUWU42OXdjZnUzbTJKY3Rkc1ozeV9FbURlR2pnREhmMUc0VkNySE9LYmltcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxOUTlkRXhpdTRCZ2g4U0hDdDlkZlBWVDFkTTg2WWhBUXktS3c4akJZck9XbHdmdkpsazJiSVdjUmcxdFdZRmhITzEwRU9vS0pUNkFWSThqZlhYMUVWVnV3ZHRtRVlvdDdrSWhQSGQ0Zy1HOXhNbDEydkRscGV1eG04Q1A4a0VlajhCLTJpVTJYMVhzVzgzb0VTLUpURGl4c0VvanhreWVJcm1RUFNzRnFUMjliUl